```conf
$TTL 86400
// Default TTL for the DNS records in this zone.
// 86400 seconds = 24 hours.

@   IN  SOA ns1.grupo5.local. admin.grupo5.local. (
        2026092901   // Serial number of the zone
        3600         // Refresh time
        1800         // Retry time
        604800       // Expiration time
        86400        // Negative cache TTL
)

// SOA = Start of Authority.
// It defines the main DNS server for the zone and basic timing values.

@           IN  NS  ns1.grupo5.local.
// Defines ns1.grupo5.local as the authoritative DNS server for this zone.

ns1         IN  A   192.168.56.10
// IP address of the DNS server.

www         IN  A   192.168.56.10
// IP address used for www.grupo5.local.

mail        IN  A   192.168.56.30
// IP address used for mail.grupo5.local.

database    IN  A   192.168.56.40
// IP address used for database.grupo5.local.
```
